Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- /demo/p2e?journey=demo reads the contract's parameters (lib/journey.ts): course=opp-course-001 opens solar-pv,
  yoid=yoid-ng-7f3a0123 is Halima (learner=yp-001 for the embed), return is followed only when http: or https:
- arriving card "From PathFinder · Phase 2" / Learning Plan / plan step / "✓ Recorded on your YoID (mock-up)"
- YoID strip "YoID · yoid-ng-7f3a0123 · mock-up": Saved Opportunity and Learning Plan recorded, Skill Credential in
  progress until the embed posts skilllens:yoid with cred-002 recorded, Job Application next
- leaving card "Handing on to YoCV · Phase 4" / Skill Credential with "Continue to YoCV": link 3 to
  NEXT_PUBLIC_YOCV_URL (default http://localhost:4174), same tab, every parameter passed on plus from=skilllens and
  credential=cred-002
- "Back to the listing" in the header, from return
- page.tsx is now a small server wrapper that parses the parameters; the client page moved to HostDemo.tsx. Without
  journey=demo it renders as before. The embed and its messages are unchanged.
- Yoma blue as a theme token (--color-journey) for the handoff button, brand purple text on it (5.5:1)
- 13 tests for parameter parsing, the return check, link 3 and the thread states (lib/journey.test.ts)

